"entity": {
"name": "Deluxe Corporation",
"description": "Deluxe Corp. engages in the provision of marketing products and services. It operates through the following segments: Merchant Services, B2B Payments, Data Solutions, and Print. The Merchant Services segment focuses on the in-store, online, and mobile payment solutions that provide tools to accept electronic payments, such as debit cards, credit cards, and other forms of payment. The B2B Payments segment includes automated receivables technology, including remittance and lockbox processing, remote deposit capture, and cash application, as well as payment acceptance solutions. The Data Solutions segment is composed of data, analytics, and marketing services for business-to-business and business to consumer marketing. The Print segment offers printed business and personal checks. The company was founded by W. R. Hotchkiss in 1915 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, MN.",
